  "description": "InvoiceShelf is an open-source web & mobile app that helps you track expenses, payments & create professional invoices & estimates. InvoiceShelf is a fork of Crater that focuses in stability, updates and new features. The Web Application is made using Laravel & VueJS while the Mobile Apps are built using React Native.",
  "paths": [
    {
